     "text": "ספירה: $n$ אי-זוגי $2\\cdot\\frac{n-1}{2}$; $n$ זוגי $2\\left(\\frac{n}{2}-1\\right)+1$; בשני המקרים $n-1$",
     "points": 2,
     "html": "ספירה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span> אי-זוגי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\cdot\\frac{n-1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>; <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span> זוגי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\left(\\frac{n}{2}-1\\right)+1</annotation></semantics></math></span>; בשני המקרים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n-1</annotation></semantics></math></span>"
