    "לבחור רק <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>select</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{select}(\\lceil n/3\\rceil)</annotation></semantics></math></span> או רק <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>select</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{select}(\\lceil 2n/3\\rceil)</annotation></semantics></math></span> לשליש: הסרט עלול לא להופיע במקום אחד מהם.",
    "לעגל כלפי מטה במספור מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span>: במערך <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[1,2,3,3]</annotation></semantics></math></span> המקומות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span> מפספסים את <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span>, שמופיע יותר משליש מהפעמים.",
