     "points": 3,
     "html": "בדיקה שגם המשלים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z-x</annotation></semantics></math></span> מקיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C[z-x-(n+1)]&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span> והחזרת הזוג"
