   "topicLabel": "נוסחאות נסיגה ומשפט האב",
   "questionHtml": "פיתחתם בעצמכם אלגוריתם רקורסיבי למשימה זו, וחישבתם כי הסיבוכיות שלו הינה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(n) = 3T(n/2) + n^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>השתמשו בשיטת האב כדי לפתור את הנוסחה הנתונה. פרטו איזה מהמקרים רלוונטי לנוסחה זו והסבירו כיצד הגעתם למסקנה.",
   "solutionHtml": "לפי שיטת האב: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a = 3</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b = 2</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n) = n^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>צריך לבדוק את <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^{\\log_b a} = n^{\\log_2 3}</annotation></semantics></math></span> מול <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n) = n^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>3</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_2 3 &lt; 2</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5 &lt; 2</annotation></semantics></math></span> (<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">□</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{\\square} = 3</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">□</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\square \\approx 1.5</annotation></semantics></math></span>).<br>לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n) = \\Omega(n^{\\log_b a + \\varepsilon})</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≥</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n) = n^2 \\ge n^{\\log_2 3 + \\varepsilon}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>השלמה (חסרה בפתרון הסטודנט), תנאי הרגולריות: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a\\,f(n/b)=3\\left(\\frac{n}{2}\\right)^2=\\frac34 n^2\\le c\\cdot n^2</annotation></semantics></math></span> עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=\\frac34&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>ולכן לפי המשפט השלישי: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(n) = \\Theta(f(n)) = \\Theta(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
