   "questionHtml": "סעיף זה עומד בפני עצמו, ואינו קשור לפונקציה <code class=\"tok\" dir=\"ltr\">MYSTERY</code> שבראש השאלה או לשני הסעיפים הקודמים.<br><br>לפניכם נוסחת נסיגה. האם היא ניתנת לפתרון בעזרת שיטת האב (משפט המסטר)? אם כן, פתרו אותה (הראו דרך). אם לא, הסבירו מדוע לא.<br><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(n) = 3T\\left(\\frac{n}{2}\\right) + n</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "כן, הנוסחה מתאימה לשיטת האב: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(n) = aT(n/b) + f(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span> עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a = 3</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b = 2</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n) = n</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>≈</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>1.585</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^{\\log_b a} = n^{\\log_2 3} \\approx n^{1.585}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n) = n = O\\left(n^{\\log_2 3 - \\varepsilon}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span> למשל עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon = 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_2 3 - 0.5 &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span>. זהו המקרה הראשון של משפט האב, ולכן:<br><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Θ</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(n) = \\Theta\\left(n^{\\log_2 3}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
   "pointsTotal": 10,
   "pitfallsHtml": [
    "לבלבל בין <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span> ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span> ולהשוות את <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^{\\log_3 2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
    "לבחור במקרה השלישי כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ״נראה גדול״: החזקה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.585</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.585</annotation></semantics></math></span> גדולה מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
   ]
