   "topic": "recurrences",
   "question": "זמן הריצה של אלגוריתם כלשהו נתון כך:\n$T(n) = 3T\\left(\\frac{n}{9}\\right) + n$\n\nאזי: $T(n) = \\Theta(n^2)$. נכון / לא נכון",
   "points": 5,
   "part": "ג",
   "contextId": "25S-B-c5",
   "solution": "לא נכון.\n\nלפי שיטת האב: $a = 3$, $b = 9$, $n^{\\log_9 3} = n^{1/2}$, ו-$f(n) = n = \\Omega(n^{1/2 + \\varepsilon})$. תנאי הרגולריות מתקיים: $3 \\cdot \\frac{n}{9} = \\frac{1}{3} n$. זה המקרה השלישי, ולכן $T(n) = \\Theta(n)$, וזה אינו $\\Theta(n^2)$.",
   "solutionSource": "solved",
   "official": false,
   "confidence": "high",
   "verdict": false,
   "id": "25S-B-Q5c",
   "partKey": "c",
   "examCode": "25S-B",
   "examLabel": "מבני נתונים, סמסטר קיץ תשפ\"ה, מועד ב (20.11.25)",
   "year": 2025,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "נוסחאות נסיגה ומשפט האב",
   "questionHtml": "זמן הריצה של אלגוריתם כלשהו נתון כך:<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(n) = 3T\\left(\\frac{n}{9}\\right) + n</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br>אזי: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(n) = \\Theta(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span>. נכון / לא נכון",
   "solutionHtml": "לא נכון.<br><br>לפי שיטת האב: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a = 3</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b = 9</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>9</mn></msub><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^{\\log_9 3} = n^{1/2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n) = n = \\Omega(n^{1/2 + \\varepsilon})</annotation></semantics></math></span>. תנאי הרגולריות מתקיים: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\cdot \\frac{n}{9} = \\frac{1}{3} n</annotation></semantics></math></span>. זה המקרה השלישי, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(n) = \\Theta(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, וזה אינו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Theta(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "pointsTotal": 5
